  "description": "For ages, Ha-Min has secretly pined for his childhood friend Woo-Jin but never had the guts to confess. When Woo-Jin loses all his memories of Ha-Min in an accident, Ha-Min jumps at the chance to fake a relationship, hoping to make his dreams come true. Woo-Jin eagerly embraces the lie and can’t keep his hands off Ha-Min. But will their steamy, newfound romance survive if Woo-Jin’s memories come flooding back?\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes six extra chapters.*",
